From: Dario Binacchi <dario.binacchi@amarulasolutions.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Feb 2026 17:26:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] tools: build fwumdata with tools-only_defconfig

Add CONFIG_TOOLS_FWUMDATA in tools-only_defconfig.

Signed-off-by: Dario Binacchi <dario.binacchi@amarulasolutions.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]
---
 configs/tools-only_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/tools-only_defconfig b/configs/tools-only_defconfig
index 524276591300..6db1a324c68a 100644
--- a/configs/tools-only_defconfig
+++ b/configs/tools-only_defconfig
@@ -38,3 +38,4 @@ CONFIG_TIMER=y
 # CONFIG_EFI_LOADER is not set
 CONFIG_TOOLS_MKEFICAPSULE=y
 CONFIG_TOOLS_MKFWUMDATA=y
+CONFIG_TOOLS_FWUMDATA=y
